{"type":"message","id":"60c901fa","parentId":"93421ee4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T11:29:35.680Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"From the Docker Hub page, the latest version is `2026.4.1`. The `latest` and `2026.4.1` tags point to the same image (sha256:60cb5c9477c4). Also noted that versions 2026.3.2 and 2026.2.26 have been unstable/broken.\n\nLet me provide this info to the user.","thinkingSignature":"026a505a7d44209271005c8b1fe14275cd367ce49f5eb45e3b278ee166ec00fd"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n是的，OpenClaw 最近有更新！Docker Hub 显示最新版本是 **2026.4.1**（约 4 小时前更新）。\n\n当前可用版本：\n\n| Tag | 说明 |\n|-----|------|\n| `latest` / `2026.4.1` | 最新稳定版 |\n| `2026.4.1-beta.1` | Beta 版 |\n| `2026.4.1-slim` | 精简版（~795MB vs ~1GB） |\n| `main` | 基于 main 分支的最新构建 |\n\n拉取命令：\n```bash\ndocker pull alpine/openclaw:latest\n# 或指定版本\ndocker pull alpine/openclaw:2026.4.1\n```\n\n⚠️ 历史记录里提到 **2026.3.2 和 2026.2.26 有问题**，不稳定，建议跳过这两个版本直接用最新的 2026.4.1。\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":4477,"output":284,"cacheRead":11920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16681,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775129364728,"responseId":"061d8615e1ce4713c165fbc74dba60c9"}}
