{"type":"message","id":"d983f310","parentId":"a246c63c","timestamp":"2026-04-03T03:47:00.703Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I keep needing approvals for each command. Let me ask the user to run the commands directly, since this approval dance is taking too long. Alternatively, let me just spawn a sub-agent to handle this which might have different permissions.\n\nActually, let me just ask the user to run the commands directly.","thinkingSignature":"faa9133d14ffd53d3a20afbd4fa39507f9e020390617e43cef68ac8062c02caa"},{"type":"text","text":"每次命令都要单独批准，有点慢。你可以直接在服务器终端跑这个，等几秒后再查：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 运行测试\nopenclaw cron run config-backup-8am\n\n# 2. 等待10秒\nsleep 10\n\n# 3. 看状态\nopenclaw cron list\n```\n\n把第二次 `openclaw cron list` 的结果发我，看看 `config-backup-8am` 这次是否变成 `ok` 了。\n\n另外，第三个 every 2h 的任务也没写名字，是哪个 job？你可以用 `openclaw cron list --json` 拿到完整配置看看。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":18334,"output":192,"cacheRead":11460,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29986,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775188013381,"responseId":"061e6b2d3cf673d4bd7e2e7ada700c97"}}
