{"type":"message","id":"cffc572c","parentId":"44bd840b","timestamp":"2026-04-03T03:47:54.742Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know how to add this to exec-approvals.json. Let me help them with that.","thinkingSignature":"2bd8cef6bd6331134ed229e78a002052a4ec7202db11ca481405fdba72ecb932"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n在 `~/.openclaw/exec-approvals.json` 文件里添加。运行：\n\n```bash\ncat ~/.openclaw/exec-approvals.json\n```\n\n先看一下当前文件内容，然后把 `\"allow\": [\"openclaw cron run *\"]` 加进去。\n\n完整示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"allow\": [\n    \"openclaw cron run *\"\n  ],\n  \"deny\": []\n}\n```\n\n如果文件不存在，会被创建。保存后 cron 任务就能自动执行，不需要每次手动批准了。\n\n添加完后验证：\n\n```bash\nopenclaw doctor\n```\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":39,"output":149,"cacheRead":28491,"cacheWrite":1809,"totalTokens":30488,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775188065154,"responseId":"061e6b6154713e147a78d89ad2fbe4c2"}}
