{"type":"message","id":"a7854c0b","parentId":"6eaa607b","timestamp":"2026-04-03T03:48:00.822Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to remember that whenver there's an approval request, I should give a brief explanation of what it's for. This is a preference they want me to remember. I should acknowledge this and note it in memory/learning.","thinkingSignature":"8a63dbc252f9827f71100b48086d85f34a2a8c6f723183939dbaa46ee6e6a1f8"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，记住了。以后每次需要 `/approve` 批准时，我会先说明这个命令是要做什么的，比如：\n\n- `/approve xxx allow-once` — 批准查看 cron 任务列表\n- `/approve xxx allow-once` — 批准执行 config-backup-8am 备份任务\n- ...\n\n这样你不用猜，直接决定要不要批准。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":39,"output":124,"cacheRead":30128,"cacheWrite":584,"totalTokens":30875,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775188076136,"responseId":"061e6b6cfc3656b0aa8854ba292b9359"}}
