{"type":"message","id":"1bb130e9","parentId":"fc0d48e8","timestamp":"2026-04-03T03:49:20.422Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c7c506e4aceea0f11e8c3e8b7\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-03 03:49 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53c7c506e4aceea0f11e8c3e8b7]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a:  \"defaults\": {},是加这里还是跟他平级"}],"timestamp":1775188160417}}
{"type":"message","id":"f972fcb2","parentId":"1bb130e9","timestamp":"2026-04-03T03:49:33.103Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking where to add the \"allow\" rule in the exec-approvals.json file - whether it goes inside \"defaults\": {} or at the same level as \"defaults\". Let me give a clear answer.","thinkingSignature":"7f2792efa4c99119be004c327b8f76d25169965e4e69435681cfcffecdc75934"},{"type":"text","text":"\n<final>\n跟 `defaults` **平级**，不要加进 `defaults` 里面。\n\n正确结构：\n```json\n{\n  \"allow\": [\"openclaw cron run *\"],\n  \"deny\": [],\n  \"defaults\": {}\n}\n```\n\n你可以直接运行这个命令一键添加：\n\n```bash\ncat > ~/.openclaw/exec-approvals.json << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"allow\": [\"openclaw cron run *\"],\n  \"deny\": [],\n  \"defaults\": {}\n}\nEOF\n```\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":39,"output":156,"cacheRead":30454,"cacheWrite":685,"totalTokens":31334,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775188160421,"responseId":"061e6bc137c4f0b12d9476de564d610c"}}
